openOrder
├── Given caller is unauthorized or opening is paused
│   └── It reverts without deploying or funding an escrow
├── Given source, quantity, minimum, expiry, TTL, exact ETH value or next ID is invalid
│   └── It reverts without debiting any source
├── Given one source already has an active order
│   └── It rejects while other sources remain independent
├── Given ETH input
│   └── It wraps exactly, measures sender/escrow deltas and presigns one finite FOK order
└── Given harvested rETH input
    ├── It pulls exactly once with finite allowance
    └── Nonstandard mint, tax, extra-debit or receipt faults revert atomically
